  "instance_name": "dehumanization",
  "label": "The process of stripping away the humanity of a person or group",
  "description": "Dehumanization is the process of stripping away the humanity of a person or group, often to justify violence or discrimination against them. In the meme, the implication that killing zombies (non-human entities) is not homicide is used to dehumanize people of color, thereby trivializing racial violence. This requires understanding of the concept of dehumanization and its role in justifying violence.",
